OL,3,GNEWSARider dies after Manx Grand Prix
OL,4,Aqualifying crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA competitor has died following a crash
OL,7,Finvolving two riders during qualifying
OL,8,Ffor the Manx Grand Prix on the Isle of
OL,9,FMan.
OL,11,FThe session was red-flagged at about
OL,12,F18:50 BST following the incident at
OL,13,FCruickshanks, in Ramsey, on the opening
OL,14,Flap of Tuesday evening's session.
OL,16,FOrganisers said the other competitor
OL,17,Finvolved had suffered minor injuries
OL,18,Fand was being treated at the island's
OL,19,Fmain hospital, Noble's. The riders have
OL,20,Fnot been named.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
